<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>If you override the starting area and waypoint for a module (under <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Export%20options" title="Export options (page does not exist)">export options</a>) to a non-existent area, the game will crash without an informative error message when it tries to load up the nonexistent area.
</p><p>This can only occur under unusual circumstances. To force the toolset to override starting position to a nonexistent area you need to first set the toolset to that area, then shut down the toolset and restore a copy of the database that lacks that area.
</p>
